[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19083.51, "timestamp": "05:18:03", "text": "响亮。僚机增强。好的，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19090.868, "timestamp": "05:18:10", "text": "哇，得分很高。嗨，我是Joex。可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19094.15, "timestamp": "05:18:14", "text": "邀请我来帮忙？哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19096.35, "timestamp": "05:18:16", "text": "我会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19097.38, "timestamp": "05:18:17", "text": "之后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19099.07, "timestamp": "05:18:19", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19102.39, "timestamp": "05:18:22", "text": "嗯，评论。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19105.628, "timestamp": "05:18:25", "text": "好的，这些都是故事素材。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19107.628, "timestamp": "05:18:27", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19115.51, "timestamp": "05:18:35", "text": "有趣的山脉。我的天哪，这幅画作……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19122.708, "timestamp": "05:18:42", "text": "惊人的。哇。 Bindful 复活了。这得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19124.91, "timestamp": "05:18:44", "text": "一个男人。哦，是的，我打算这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19133.59, "timestamp": "05:18:53", "text": "我明白动画师那部分的意思了。哦，加入电话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19134.35, "timestamp": "05:18:54", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19137.23, "timestamp": "05:18:57", "text": "眨眼"}]